Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:01.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,*picks up mic*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:05.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,*tap tap tap on the mic*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:05.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,*tap tap tap on the mic*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:05.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,*tap tap tap on the mic*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, this might be an awkward video to make,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:13.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,particularly an announcement of hiatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:14.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna state my intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I do wanna get out this backstory pretty quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,In the past few months, even into last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to expand and scale up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:24.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,such as having color-coded subtitles with positioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:28.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,making gaming stream highlights, and "hiring" volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, turns out two out of the three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:32.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,might have bitten me in the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and have proven me what went wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in my way of approaching things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:39.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'm well aware that I hate editing long periods of footages,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,primarily because of the amount of time I end up spending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,sitting on the office just editing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:47.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which do not go well for someone who gets distracted easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,even when there's nothing else on other monitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because my mind drives me crazy on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:56.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Each stream, you see, ends up taking me as long as an entire month
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:01:01.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to scrub through and come up with\Nwhat I call "barebones level of editing".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then I proceed to spend another two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:06.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,getting the second pass of edits, thumbnails, and subtitling done,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which the total production time\Nfor what's essentially a stream highlight for a game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:12.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,was a month and a half on average.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,In my eyes, by the time the video gets shipped,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:17.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,a new trend or a new stream could have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:18.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the production,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which means I'll be in a new loop of hellscape,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:23.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which brings me to the second point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:26.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Second, I started "hiring",
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:29.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't really say the word "hire" in the legal sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because they're volunteering to help me out in parts of the production,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:35.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,particularly on those stream highlights\NI mentioned prior in the first point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:38.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But one jarring thing that came to my personal realization
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:41.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is that not everyone is perfect, which I don't blame them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it's primarily on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And when they realized how big of a task it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:48.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,they too agree it was too heavy of a workflow to keep going like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:52.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So before I continue, massive shout out to Wasvreta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:54.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,for editing the PEAK  highlights episode one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:57.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and constantly iterating till the very end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,for a very enjoyable video.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:02.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Special thanks to Aerostatikk for highlighting the streams
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:05.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,following that, and QC-ing my soft-coded subtitles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:08.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I could not have seen what potential
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:10.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the stream highlights could have been without you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:14.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, considering the fact that\Nthese volunteers aren't being paid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to do what they wished to help me to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I realized I need to slow down and I need to scale down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:20.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've apologized to them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.75,0:02:23.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I've brought all projects back to my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,once again to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Some of which would need a complete re-evaluation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:30.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on whether I've gone too ambitious or I've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:34.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The huge jarring L that I took was the fact\Nthat these stream highlights
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:37.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,are proven the worst performing videos time and time again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:40.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,from the first time I did it to the latest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:43.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The algorithm and you all have showed me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that you want to see more tech videos out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:47.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anything more but gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,With all that in mind, I'm gonna apologize once again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:54.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm taking another unknown period of time of hiatus
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:58.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to clean up the clutter in my rooms,\Nreorganize my entire workflows and setups,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:03.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,clean up my branding, so I can return\Nto the tried and true Melori The Tech Wizardess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:06.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The original janky way, but with a glow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:09.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, you might see occasional live streams of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:11.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,either games I really wanted to play
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or tech events like Apple events that I wanted to react to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:16.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still be around for some of those times,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:19.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but videos will have to sit behind for a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I have the mental room to scale down, quash the bad bits,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and actually think carefully which part is actually good to scale up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and then come back with a bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:32.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So if you have any suggestions,\NI'd like to hear it in the comments below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And with all of that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:35.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,thank you so so so so so much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,for supporting me with your likes, comment, subscriptions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:41.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and especially donations on my Ko-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:44.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to see y'all anywhere we can meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:13.17,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Luuna Groove - Night Breeze♫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:35.62,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Luuna Groove - カフェ_マカロン (Café Macaron)♫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Mata-Melo.
